OL,3,GNEWSAOwner risks losing Wayne Manor
OL,4,Awithout bat surveys
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a stately home used as
OL,7,FWayne Manor in the film Batman Begins
OL,8,Fcould lose the property if they do not
OL,9,Fconduct bat surveys.
OL,11,FBuckinghamshire Council has served a
OL,12,Fformal listed-building repairs notice
OL,13,Fon the company behind Grade I-listed
OL,14,FMentmore Towers in Buckinghamshire.
OL,16,FThe property could face compulsory
OL,17,Fpurchase if the owner does not provide
OL,18,Fevidence within one month that a
OL,19,Flicensed bat ecologist has been
OL,20,Fappointed to conduct surveys.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
